// Optional site settings for Sherlock, used as `pixi run pipeline ... -c /path/site.config`.
// Keep your copy outside the checkout. The sherlock profile (Slurm and Apptainer) is selected
// automatically there.
//
// Partition: the profile submits to --queue (default normal); set another here, e.g. owners.
// params.queue = 'owners'
// Account and other Slurm options: set them in your shell (e.g. export SBATCH_ACCOUNT=...) so
// the profile's own settings stay in effect.
//
// Work defaults to $SCRATCH/workspace, which Sherlock purges; output and trace files to
// $OAK/$USER/genesis/runs/RUN_NAME. Pass -P/--persist-dir to `pixi run pipeline` for another
// folder, e.g. on $GROUP_HOME; setting params.persist_dir here comes too late, as
// nextflow.config derives the paths first.
// References default to $OAK/$USER/genesis/references; pass -R/--references to
// `pixi run pipeline` to use another folder. (The wrapper passes it to Nextflow as --references,
// which takes precedence over params set in this file.)
